### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = TU_TOKEN_AQUI
@refreshToken = TU_REFRESH_TOKEN_AQUI

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###
### 1. Registro (POST /api/user/register)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

###
### 2. Validar email (PUT /api/user/validation)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/validation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "code": "123456"
}

###
### 3. Login (POST /api/user/login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

###
### 4. Onboarding personal (PUT /api/user/register)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Juan",
  "lastName": "García López",
  "nif": "12345678A",
  "address": {
    "street": "Calle Mayor 1",
    "city": "Madrid",
    "province": "Madrid",
    "postalCode": "28001"
  }
}

###
### 5a. Onboarding empresa — Empresa (PATCH /api/user/company)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/user/company
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "isFreelance": false,
  "cif": "B12345678",
  "name": "Mi Empresa SL"
}

###
### 5b. Onboarding empresa — Autónomo (PATCH /api/user/company)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/user/company
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "isFreelance": true,
  "cif": "12345678A"
}

###
### 6. Subir logo (PATCH /api/user/logo)
# Usar cliente REST que soporte multipart/form-data
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/user/logo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="logo"; filename="logo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./logo.png
--boundary--

###
### 7. Obtener usuario (GET /api/user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### 8a. Refresh token (POST /api/user/refresh)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###
### 8b. Logout (POST /api/user/logout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### 9a. Eliminar usuario — soft delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/user?soft=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### 9b. Eliminar usuario — hard delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### 10. Invitar compañero (POST /api/user/invite) — solo admins
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "guest@example.com"
}

###
### BONUS: Cambiar contraseña (PUT /api/user/password)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "Test1234!",
  "newPassword": "NewPass5678!",
  "confirmPassword": "NewPass5678!"
}
